{"257730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infinity Wars: Animated Trading Card Game", "steam_appid": 257730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [3855400, 4695450], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/acea6be5b766bbb74a12fa5764b73f96.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIONEER OF SIMULTANEOUS TURNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players plan their turns simultaneously, with every action resolving at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a fast-paced contest of prediction, bluffing, and anticipation, without the long waits between turns found in traditional card games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneered by <i>Infinity Wars</i> in 2012, simultaneous turns remain a standout in game design, and more than a decade later, few games have rivalled its strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/61b02910712c63138800c7f3b3c61322.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAUTIFULLY ANIMATED CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card in <i>Infinity Wars</i> is fully illustrated and animated, bringing each piece of art to life on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From characters to abilities, every card features unique animation that adds visual depth and energy to every match, redefining what a card game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/9ac1984db1618865c5093ba95f175881.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE COMMANDER-BASED DECK BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your strategy and lead your deck with three Commanders that define your strategy and unlock powerful faction bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Commanders from different factions for flexible hybrid decks, or specialize in a single faction to access its strongest cards and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless Commander combinations to explore, the possibilities are nearly endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/751646f90bb2ca335b62242506986a03.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH TO PAY-TO-WIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Infinity Wars</i> believes in <strong>Death to Pay-to-Win</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build any deck, experiment with any strategy, and compete on a truly level playing field. Every player has access to the complete competitive card library, allowing skill, not spending, to determine the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes from deckbuilding, prediction, and gameplay mastery, not collection size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/300ca0e988a4231cbda9b2ce19d404b5.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP BACK INTO THE ACTION!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Returning to Infinity Wars?</strong><br>Your original collection is waiting, jump straight back into the fight with your original collection intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Request an account transfer to restore your cards, cosmetics, and currency, and continue your journey where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/acea6be5b766bbb74a12fa5764b73f96.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIONEER OF SIMULTANEOUS TURNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players plan their turns simultaneously, with every action resolving at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a fast-paced contest of prediction, bluffing, and anticipation, without the long waits between turns found in traditional card games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneered by <i>Infinity Wars</i> in 2012, simultaneous turns remain a standout in game design, and more than a decade later, few games have rivalled its strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/61b02910712c63138800c7f3b3c61322.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAUTIFULLY ANIMATED CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card in <i>Infinity Wars</i> is fully illustrated and animated, bringing each piece of art to life on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From characters to abilities, every card features unique animation that adds visual depth and energy to every match, redefining what a card game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/9ac1984db1618865c5093ba95f175881.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE COMMANDER-BASED DECK BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your strategy and lead your deck with three Commanders that define your strategy and unlock powerful faction bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Commanders from different factions for flexible hybrid decks, or specialize in a single faction to access its strongest cards and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless Commander combinations to explore, the possibilities are nearly endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/751646f90bb2ca335b62242506986a03.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH TO PAY-TO-WIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Infinity Wars</i> believes in <strong>Death to Pay-to-Win</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build any deck, experiment with any strategy, and compete on a truly level playing field. Every player has access to the complete competitive card library, allowing skill, not spending, to determine the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes from deckbuilding, prediction, and gameplay mastery, not collection size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/300ca0e988a4231cbda9b2ce19d404b5.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP BACK INTO THE ACTION!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Returning to Infinity Wars?</strong><br>Your original collection is waiting, jump straight back into the fight with your original collection intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Request an account transfer to restore your cards, cosmetics, and currency, and continue your journey where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/extras/3c17df5592eaed2599eb8a88772f91b3.avif?t=1782795400\" width=1186 height=165 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Outplay your opponent with simultaneous turns and commander-driven deck-building in a fully free-to-play PvP experience. Build your deck from 1000+ cards across 8 unique factions, and face opponents on a truly level playing field. In Infinity Wars, skill is the only factor that determines victory!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The single best designed digital card game on the market!”<br>Colt Hallam, Lead Game Designer at Riot Games<br><br>“I have been waiting for a TCG like this for a long time.”<br>Examiner<br><br>“[While at the Australian EB Expo] Nothing even came close to the level of quality of Infinity Wars. It almost shouldn't have been in the same area; it should have been in an open space, where everybody was guaranteed to walk by. The game deserved that level of foot traffic.”<br>ABC Tech<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/21f7aa45ac04b962e2bd4860036567a94266478d/header.jpg?t=1782795400", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/eb9cf46bfef1636e3db9be7b1c4d00f17281e3f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782795400", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257730/eb9cf46bfef1636e3db9be7b1c4d00f17281e3f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782795400", "website": "http://www.infinitywarsgame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DirectX 9 capabilities.<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.5 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2